# Build context of the admin image (docker build -f apps/admin/Dockerfile .).
# Allowlist: the manifests and the lockfile, the sources of this app and of the shared packages, the nginx configuration.
# Nothing of the user app but its manifest (the lockfile lists it). Neither node_modules nor build output nor .env
# reach the build: dependencies are installed from the lockfile inside the image.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!.npmrc
!nginx/
!apps/*/package.json
!apps/admin/nginx.conf.template
!apps/admin/tsconfig.json
!apps/admin/vite.config.ts
!apps/admin/src/
!packages/*/package.json
!packages/*/tsconfig.json
!packages/*/src/

# Inside the allowed directories
**/*.test.ts
**/.DS_Store
